I think the main reason limiting the race/class combinations are the
alignment limitations.
For example, orcs are always chaotic. And valkyries are either neutral or
lawful. Therefore you can't start the game as an orcish valkyrie.
Humans are the only race that can start with any alignment.

OTOH, the alignment is not the ONLY limitation there is: priests and monks
can be of any alignment, but only humans can be monks and only humans or
elves can be priests.. and only lawful humans can start as a knight or
samurai and neutral humans as a tourist,

